    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/a9603be004ad064d9ede536932b165fe.avif?t=1753385270\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ZeroSpace is a sci-fi hybrid strategy game that allows you to play as the commander of a galactic army. Outfit your flagship as you collect new technology, units and crew members, and thread through political turmoil in the Orion sector as you take over planetary systems in the name of your faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot of thought and care went into creating ZeroSpace's universe and lore. ZeroSpace prioritizes both consistency and spectacle in its presentation, with a unique hard-science universe feel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An epic sci-fi story with choices that set up a galactic conflict</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make choices that change the universe, inspired by classic narrative RPGs like Mass Effect and Baldur's Gate. Build deep relationships with your crew and the heroes you enlist during the campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/f7d01697e969b94d3f3e2ab5cf3682fc.poster.avif?t=1753385270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/f7d01697e969b94d3f3e2ab5cf3682fc.webm?t=1753385270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/f7d01697e969b94d3f3e2ab5cf3682fc.mp4?t=1753385270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose your strategy with over 11 factions and 14 heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct a crushing strategy by choosing from 80 units, through 4 factions, 7 mercenary factions and 14 heroes, making each game different and unlocking more opportunities for dynamic counterplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/0_X4fpYl.gif?t=1753385270\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Comfortable strategic and skill play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel comfortable with ZeroSpace's simple and streamlined UI. Comfort means you're doing exactly what you want without having to think about it. Want to draw your unit formation? Just right-click drag. Cast abilities through a shared ability UI without swapping tabs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/herofight2.gif?t=1753385270\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge yourself further in the persistent, massively multiplayer Galaxy War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/61cebadadf70c718e0f88f914db08a74.poster.avif?t=1753385270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/61cebadadf70c718e0f88f914db08a74.webm?t=1753385270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/61cebadadf70c718e0f88f914db08a74.mp4?t=1753385270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be the ultimate strategy commander as you take part in a living, breathing galaxy shared by thousands of real players. Defend your territory and conquer neighboring planets by leading a vast armada of troops, aliens, creatures, vehicles, and heavy weaponry- all for the glory of your alliance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Persistent, Massively Multiplayer Galaxy Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/40483df51216e13478058674f82fb5dd.poster.avif?t=1753385270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/40483df51216e13478058674f82fb5dd.webm?t=1753385270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/40483df51216e13478058674f82fb5dd.mp4?t=1753385270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Galactic War, you command a legion of troops stationed on your flagship. Coordinate alongside other alliance members to deploy troops on enemy planets, space stations and strongholds across the galaxy. On the ground, you must command your army to victory in order to gain influence, renown and to expand alliance territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features &amp; Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A singleplayer campaign with <strong>13 main story missions, 14 hero loyalty missions, and 20 side story arcs. </strong>With choices and dialog trees similar to Mass Effect and Baldur's Gate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An MMO Galaxy map with multiple game modes (Co-op, Single-player, PvE, 2vAI, 2v2, Scenarios and 1v1) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hours of cinematic cutscenes and interactive dialogs</strong> where your choices dictate the game\u2019s outcome. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 main factions</strong>, with 10 units and 9 buildings each and talents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>7 mercenary factions</strong>, with 3-5 units each, buildings and talents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>14 heroes</strong> from various factions in campaign mode, or select one to lead your multiplayer games.<br><br>  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wishlist ZeroSpace today!</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/a9603be004ad064d9ede536932b165fe.avif?t=1753385270\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ZeroSpace is a sci-fi hybrid strategy game that allows you to play as the commander of a galactic army. Outfit your flagship as you collect new technology, units and crew members, and thread through political turmoil in the Orion sector as you take over planetary systems in the name of your faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot of thought and care went into creating ZeroSpace's universe and lore. ZeroSpace prioritizes both consistency and spectacle in its presentation, with a unique hard-science universe feel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An epic sci-fi story with choices that set up a galactic conflict</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make choices that change the universe, inspired by classic narrative RPGs like Mass Effect and Baldur's Gate. Build deep relationships with your crew and the heroes you enlist during the campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/f7d01697e969b94d3f3e2ab5cf3682fc.poster.avif?t=1753385270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/f7d01697e969b94d3f3e2ab5cf3682fc.webm?t=1753385270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/f7d01697e969b94d3f3e2ab5cf3682fc.mp4?t=1753385270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose your strategy with over 11 factions and 14 heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct a crushing strategy by choosing from 80 units, through 4 factions, 7 mercenary factions and 14 heroes, making each game different and unlocking more opportunities for dynamic counterplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/0_X4fpYl.gif?t=1753385270\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Comfortable strategic and skill play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel comfortable with ZeroSpace's simple and streamlined UI. Comfort means you're doing exactly what you want without having to think about it. Want to draw your unit formation? Just right-click drag. Cast abilities through a shared ability UI without swapping tabs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/herofight2.gif?t=1753385270\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge yourself further in the persistent, massively multiplayer Galaxy War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/61cebadadf70c718e0f88f914db08a74.poster.avif?t=1753385270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/61cebadadf70c718e0f88f914db08a74.webm?t=1753385270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/61cebadadf70c718e0f88f914db08a74.mp4?t=1753385270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be the ultimate strategy commander as you take part in a living, breathing galaxy shared by thousands of real players. Defend your territory and conquer neighboring planets by leading a vast armada of troops, aliens, creatures, vehicles, and heavy weaponry- all for the glory of your alliance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Persistent, Massively Multiplayer Galaxy Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/40483df51216e13478058674f82fb5dd.poster.avif?t=1753385270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/40483df51216e13478058674f82fb5dd.webm?t=1753385270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605850/extras/40483df51216e13478058674f82fb5dd.mp4?t=1753385270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Galactic War, you command a legion of troops stationed on your flagship. Coordinate alongside other alliance members to deploy troops on enemy planets, space stations and strongholds across the galaxy. On the ground, you must command your army to victory in order to gain influence, renown and to expand alliance territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features &amp; Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A singleplayer campaign with <strong>13 main story missions, 14 hero loyalty missions, and 20 side story arcs. </strong>With choices and dialog trees similar to Mass Effect and Baldur's Gate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An MMO Galaxy map with multiple game modes (Co-op, Single-player, PvE, 2vAI, 2v2, Scenarios and 1v1) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hours of cinematic cutscenes and interactive dialogs</strong> where your choices dictate the game\u2019s outcome. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 main factions</strong>, with 10 units and 9 buildings each and talents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>7 mercenary factions</strong>, with 3-5 units each, buildings and talents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>14 heroes</strong> from various factions in campaign mode, or select one to lead your multiplayer games.<br><br>  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wishlist ZeroSpace today!</strong></h2>",
